# Task workflow

1. Inspect existing code.
2. Identify affected modules.
3. Explain the implementation plan briefly.
4. Implement.
5. Run formatting (Biome).
6. Run typecheck.
7. Run relevant tests.
8. Fix failures before stopping.

`data/` holds confidential competition datasets. It is gitignored; never commit, copy into the repo, or upload its contents. CI uses synthetic fixtures.
